  "body": "| | |\n| :-- | :-- |\n| **Document ID** | DOC-ISO-002 |\n| **Version** | 1.1 |\n| **Effective date** | November 2026 |\n| **Owner** | COO |\n| **Use** | One per project or major job. Record the same details on the job/project in Command Center. |\n\n## Purpose\n\nCaptures customer requirements, communication and feedback in line with ISO 9001:2015, so we can evaluate satisfaction and drive improvement.\n\n## Customer details\n\n- **Customer name:** ______________________\n- **Company:** ______________________\n- **Project / work order #:** ______________________\n\n## Requirements & communication\n\n**Key requirements (as stated by the customer):**\n\n______________________\n\n______________________\n\n**Communication notes:**\n\n______________________\n\n______________________\n\n## Completion & feedback\n\n- **Completion date:** ______________________\n- **Customer feedback:** ______________________\n- **Satisfaction rating (1–5):** ☐ 1 ☐ 2 ☐ 3 ☐ 4 ☐ 5\n\n## Follow-up actions\n\n**Improvements / next steps:**\n\n______________________\n\n______________________\n\n## Sign-off\n\n**Completed by:** ______________________ **Date:** ____________\n\n## Revision History\n\n| Version | Date | Changes | Author | Approved by |\n| :-: | :-: | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n| 1.0 | 2025 | Initial release (DOC-ISO-REF-002) | COO | CEO |\n| 1.1 | 11/2026 | ID DOC-ISO-002; formatting cleaned up | Corey Williams (COO) | Daniel Aaron (CEO) |"
